---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Split PDF Online, Free and Private | trycool"
  description="Split a PDF into separate files by cut points, pages per file, or custom page ranges. Runs in your browser, so your file is never uploaded."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-20 pt-14 sm:pt-20">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-[#666]">Free PDF tool</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#171717] sm:text-5xl">Split PDF</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#666]">
      Cut one PDF into separate files in a few taps. Pages are previewed on your screen, and your file never leaves your device.
    </p>

    <section id="tool" aria-label="Split PDF tool" class="mt-10 rounded-xl border border-[#eaeaea] bg-white p-5 sm:p-8">
      <label
        id="dropzone"
        for="file-input"
        class="flex cursor-pointer flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-dashed border-[#d4d4d4] px-6 py-12 text-center transition-colors hover:border-[#171717] focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-[#0070f3]"
      >
        <span class="text-base font-medium text-[#171717]">Choose a PDF or drop it here</span>
        <span class="mt-1 text-sm text-[#666]">Works with any PDF up to 500 pages</span>
        <input id="file-input" type="file" accept="application/pdf,.pdf" class="sr-only" />
      </label>

      <p id="file-info" class="mt-3 text-sm text-[#666]" aria-live="polite"></p>
      <p id="error" class="mt-3 hidden text-sm text-red-600" role="alert"></p>

      <div id="workspace" class="mt-8 hidden">
        <fieldset>
          <legend class="text-sm font-medium text-[#171717]">How do you want to split?</legend>
          <div class="mt-3 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-3">
            <label class="mode-card">
              <input type="radio" name="mode" value="cuts" checked class="accent-[#171717]" />
              <span>Cut points</span>
            </label>
            <label class="mode-card">
              <input type="radio" name="mode" value="every" class="accent-[#171717]" />
              <span>Every N pages</span>
            </label>
            <label class="mode-card">
              <input type="radio" name="mode" value="range" class="accent-[#171717]" />
              <span>Page ranges</span>
            </label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <div id="mode-every" class="mt-5 hidden">
          <label for="every-n" class="text-sm font-medium text-[#171717]">Pages per file</label>
          <input id="every-n" type="number" min="1" value="2" inputmode="numeric" class="field max-w-[10rem]" />
        </div>

        <div id="mode-range" class="mt-5 hidden">
          <label for="range" class="text-sm font-medium text-[#171717]">Page ranges, separated by commas</label>
          <input id="range" type="text" placeholder="1-3, 4-7" class="field" autocomplete="off" />
        </div>

        <p id="preview" class="mt-5 text-sm text-[#171717]" aria-live="polite"></p>

        <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-[#666]">
          In "Cut points" mode, tap "Cut after" under a page to start a new file after it.
        </p>
        <div id="thumbs" class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-4 md:grid-cols-5"></div>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <button id="split-btn" type="button" class="btn-primary">Split PDF</button>
          <button id="reset-btn" type="button" class="btn-secondary">Start over</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="result" class="mt-6 hidden rounded-lg border border-[#eaeaea] p-4">
        <p id="result-text" class="text-sm text-[#171717]" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <button id="download-again" type="button" class="btn-secondary mt-3">Download again</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="how" class="mt-16">
      <h2 id="how" class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#171717]">How it works</h2>
      <ol class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <li class="rounded-lg border border-[#eaeaea] p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#171717]">1. Choose your PDF</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#666]">Page previews appear within seconds, so you can see what you are splitting.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-lg border border-[#eaeaea] p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#171717]">2. Pick a split style</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#666]">Cut at chosen pages, make files of a fixed size, or type your own page ranges.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="rounded-lg border border-[#eaeaea] p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#171717]">3. Download</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#666]">One result downloads as a PDF. Several results download together as a ZIP.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="faq" class="mt-16">
      <h2 id="faq" class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#171717]">Questions</h2>
      <dl class="mt-6 divide-y divide-[#eaeaea] border-y border-[#eaeaea]">
        <div class="py-5">
          <dt class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#171717]">Is my file uploaded anywhere?</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#666]">No. Splitting happens inside your browser. The page makes no request that carries your PDF.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="py-5">
          <dt class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#171717]">Does it add a watermark?</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#666]">No. The files you download are the same pages from your original PDF.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="py-5">
          <dt class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#171717]">Why won't my PDF open?</dt>
          <dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#666]">Password-protected PDFs must be unlocked first. Very large files can be slow on older phones.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    import '../scripts/splitter';
  </script>
</Layout>
